{"id":3422,"date":"2026-06-24T12:53:17","date_gmt":"2026-06-24T12:53:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=3422"},"modified":"2026-10-02T06:19:06","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T06:19:06","slug":"golden-sand-rustic-cube-wall-cladding-stone","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/golden-sand-rustic-cube-wall-cladding-stone\/","title":{"rendered":"Golden Sand Rustic Cube Wall Cladding Stone"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"1142\">Introduce natural warmth and handcrafted architectural beauty with <strong data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"641\">Golden Sand Rustic Cube Wall Cladding Stone<\/strong>, a premium decorative wall cladding surface inspired by the timeless appeal of natural sandstone formations. Designed with precisely cut square and rectangular stone blocks arranged in a random interlocking mosaic layout, this cladding creates remarkable visual depth and an organic handcrafted appearance. The rich blend of warm golden beige, soft sandstone cream, muted honey tones, and subtle earthy variations gives the surface an elegant natural character that instantly enhances premium spaces.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1745\">Carefully crafted for luxury residential and commercial environments, this wall cladding stone combines authentic natural texture with exceptional structural durability. Its rough textured split-face finish highlights the raw beauty of stone craftsmanship while creating dramatic shadow play and architectural depth across vertical surfaces. Perfect for feature walls, grand staircases, hotel interiors, luxury reception areas, premium commercial elevations, and designer architectural installations, it serves as a sophisticated decorative surface built to deliver long-lasting premium visual impact.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wc2bmo\" data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1779\">Product Specifications<\/h2>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<di